        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "5 months ago",
        "text": "I’ve been seeing Serena Kubic for several months now, and I can confidently say that working with them has been truly life-changing. From the very first session, they created a safe, non-judgmental space where I felt heard and understood.\n\nThey have an incredible ability to listen deeply and ask thoughtful, insightful questions that have helped me gain clarity and work through some long-standing challenges. Their approach is compassionate, grounded, and genuinely empowering. I never feel rushed, and I always leave each session with something valuable to reflect on or apply in my day-to-day life.\n\nIf you’re looking for a therapist who is warm, skilled, and deeply committed to helping you grow, I can’t recommend Serena Kubic enough. They’ve made a meaningful difference in my mental health and personal growth.",
